{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game","id":127973,"title":"Interest Check For A Slightly-Off-the-Wall Mortal/Hunter Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-07T21:30:26-07:00","id":127973,"title":"Interest Check For A Slightly-Off-the-Wall Mortal/Hunter Game","content":"Hello all,<br /> <br /> I'm looking to run a Mortal/Hunter game, possibly in the epistolary format given by Cire's mage games (there will be a vote), that is slightly off the wall. Off the wall, as in, I maaaay cross it over with a certain...TV show based on a comic book line. I'd like to keep it a surprise until the game is finally put down, but I am looking for a minimum of 3-5 players. I will take more if there is interest, but if I do, it's likely there will be no more than 7-8 people in this particular session. I may lose track of people's character sheets after that.<br /> <br /> <b>Setting: </b>Wyoming. It's open, it's sparsely-populated, and has plenty of potential for weird types of events that you won't get backup for.<br /> <br /> <b>Rules: </b>I am putting it up to a vote whether or not we use pre- or post-GMC rules.<br /> <br /> <b>House Rules: </b>Anything we start with will be from the Hunter and Mortal corebook only. The only tweak is that your characters may be &quot;gifted&quot; \u2014 that is, you can sacrifice three merit points at creation to put three dots in any Dread Power of your choice, but it must be justified in your backstory. How your powers will be upgraded will be decided depending on what ruleset we use, and if it's an epistolary chronicle or not.<br /> <br /> <b>Game Length: </b>It depends on how long the story goes. We may finish it quickly, we may finish it slowly \u2014 it depends on the development on the plot. There will be a posting order, but if someone doesn't post for more than 72 hours, you can go ahead and post ahead of them.<br /> <br /> <b>Medium: </b>It'll be run on WW's play-by-post forum. I'm currently looking for a good dice roller in case we use dice.<br /> <br /> SO!<br /> <br /> If interested, please post below, and please state if you want to use pre-GMC or post-GMC rules, along with whether or not you want a diceless epistolary game or a typical dice game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T01:06:16-07:00","id":128069,"title":"","content":"I would be interested in joining. My personal preferences on the above are: -Post-GMC Rules -With Dice... Though I've never actually tried epistolary so I'm open to that as well if others prefer that. I'll need to read up on Cire's game you mentioned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T15:24:21-07:00","id":128556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BridgeWarden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=128069#post128069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would be interested in joining. My personal preferences on the above are: -Post-GMC Rules -With Dice... Though I've never actually tried epistolary so I'm open to that as well if others prefer that. I'll need to read up on Cire's game you mentioned.</div> </div> </div> </div>The epistolary chronicle I ran before can be found here, if you'd like an example of it: <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/default9d04.html?g=posts&amp;t=59957\" target=\"_blank\">http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/d...=posts&amp;t=59957</a><br /> <br /> The rules (pre-GMC, this was before GMC came out) can be found here, and tweaked to fit GMC: <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/default75a5.html?g=posts&amp;t=59168\" target=\"_blank\">http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/d...=posts&amp;t=59168</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T15:54:56-07:00","id":128585,"title":"","content":"I'm reading up on your epistolary chronicle now... seems interesting. I'd be up for it if other folks are. Either way should work for me then! One thing- If we're going Hunter/Mortal core only, I assume we won't be using any of the new GMC stuff for Hunter found in Mortal Remains? I'm fine either way, just wanted to clarify since that more or less updates Hunter to GMC standards.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T16:06:07-07:00","id":128596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BridgeWarden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=128585#post128585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm reading up on your epistolary chronicle now... seems interesting. I'd be up for it if other folks are. Either way should work for me then! One thing- If we're going Hunter/Mortal core only, I assume we won't be using any of the new GMC stuff for Hunter found in Mortal Remains? I'm fine either way, just wanted to clarify since that more or less updates Hunter to GMC standards.</div> </div> </div> </div>I will be likely using the fluff in GMC to supplement my games, but I will also use the ruleset if there's a majority vote on GMC rules. I'm trying to do a game that requires as few books as possible, so that more people can access it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T16:16:23-07:00","id":128607,"title":"","content":"Okay, makes sense. I'm going to start thinking on some character concepts, and hopefully some others will be show an interest soon as well. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avat