rder=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T13:00:44-07:00","id":130091,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in doing a pbp Hunter game with post-GMC rules. Tier 1, Tier 2, Tier 3?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T14:46:51-07:00","id":130179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=130091#post130091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be interested in doing a pbp Hunter game with post-GMC rules. Tier 1, Tier 2, Tier 3?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mixed. It's a Tier-1-type setting, but you can pick from any conspiracy or compact in the corebook to be. Depending on how things go, the plot may move outside of Wyoming in-game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T15:09:23-07:00","id":130294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=130179#post130179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mixed. It's a Tier-1-type setting, but you can pick from any conspiracy or compact in the corebook to be. Depending on how things go, the plot may move outside of Wyoming in-game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool! I was thinking either an Ashwood Abbey member or a Null Mysteriis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T15:31:43-07:00","id":130426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=130294#post130294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Cool! I was thinking either an Ashwood Abbey member or a Null Mysteriis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whatever you'd like to do, I'm fine with. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> The game can be as flexible or accommodating as it needs to be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T17:23:40-07:00","id":131063,"title":"","content":"In case it helps with choosing a character- mine is going to be a Lucifuge, occult author by day, demon summoner/banisher by night. Heavy on the Int/Pres, low on the physical abilities. More of a researcher who is willing to use his bloodline to gain information as well as giving demons a chance to be useful for something other than tempting mortals. He'd probably lean towards the Reconciliation philosophy from the HtV core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T18:58:08-07:00","id":131171,"title":"","content":"I'll go with an Ashwood Abbey debutante; trust fund kid by day, seeker of perverse pleasures around the clock. Physical / Social with a bevy of &quot;gentlemen hunting&quot; skills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T19:12:53-07:00","id":131196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=131171#post131171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll go with an Ashwood Abbey debutante; trust fund kid by day, seeker of perverse pleasures around the clock. Physical / Social with a bevy of &quot;gentlemen hunting&quot; skills.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want, you can also PM me any sheets you might have made up for him. Would you guys also like any links to image-making sites so you can make images of them? Might add a touch of flair to the PBP; I've seen other people do it, and it might give you a bit more creative freedom than just yanking a photo off Google. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T19:20:34-07:00","id":131198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=131196#post131196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you want, you can also PM me any sheets you might have made up for him. Would you guys also like any links to image-making sites so you can make images of them? Might add a touch of flair to the PBP; I've seen other people do it, and it might give you a bit more creative freedom than just yanking a photo off Google. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">&gt;Implying I can use image editing software proficiently</span><br /> <br /> Seriously, though, I have an idea for the character but I need to know if we'll be doing 10 merit dots or 7 merit dots to start with, it'll change the character slightly. If we get 10 I can put 3 dots in the Archery fighting style for a reflexive reload, otherwise I'm going with guns (pew pew!).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T20:49:41-07:00","id":131490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=131198#post131198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">&gt;Implying I can use image editing software proficiently</span><br /> <br /> Seriously, though, I have an idea for the character but I need to know if we'll be doing 10 merit dots or 7 merit dots to start with, it'll change the character slightly. If we get 10 I can put 3 dots in the Archery fighting style for a reflexive reload, otherwise I'm going with guns (pew pew!).</div> </div> </div> </div>So far, the vote seems GMC, so you would start with ten merit dots. I would keep two versions of your character sheet at the ready, just in case there's a last-minute vote to do pre-GMC or epistolary.<br /> <br /> As for the image makers:<br /> <br /> <b>Heromachine:</b> <a href=\"http://www.heromachine.com/heromachine-3-lab/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.heromachine.com/heromachine-3-lab/</a><br /> <br /> <b>Tektek Avatar Maker: </b><a href=\"http://tektek.org/dream_avatar/\" target=\"_blank\">http://tektek.org/dream_avatar/</a><br /> <br /> Try one of those if you would like to make a portrait for your character. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T14:07:08-07:00","id":132772,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://s1292.photobucket.com/user/potatouprising23/media/WoD/Brian_zps33da4bdd.jpg.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i1292.photobucket.com/albums/b571/potatouprising23/WoD/th_Brian_zps33da4bdd.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> Brian Devereux<br /> Age 33<br /> Lucifuge<br /> Born in France, family came to live in Northern Virginia around 1985. Discovered his infernal heritage in college, resulting in his first accidental summoning. Luckily the agents of the Lucifuge found him before too much damage could be done. He traveled to Milan briefly, before being shipped off to Wyoming for Lady Lucifuge-only-knows-why. Perhaps it's a punishment for his naive convictions about using dark powers for good. Perhaps it's because of some dire need his conspiracy has for him to go there. Perhaps Bigfoot. Regardless, he was shipped home and is driving up to Wyoming with a trunk full of arcane goodies for <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">summoning </span>banishing infernal beasts and the like.<br /> <br /> I'm planning on having Brian hole up inside a cabin of some sort on the outskirts of town. Or maybe he'll rent a place while he's there... either way expect it to be cramped with the necessary shelf space for all his summoning and banishing materials, an old laptop for writing, and a small row of occult books he uses for his research.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":1204,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","user":"BridgeWarden","date":".  Typo. 05-11-2014, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T14:52:11-07:00","id":132804,"title":"","content":"Vincent Mortain<br /> Height: 5'8&quot;<br /> Weight: 140lbs<br /> Hair: Dirty Blond<br /> Eyes: Brown<br /> Appearance: Handsome and Fit<br /> <br /> Vincent Mortain is a semi-Professional archer and a trust fund kid. He graduated Harvard with gentleman's Cs with a degree in Humanities. After graduation he spent his time traveling the world hunting big game and exotic entertainment (preferably female and humanoid, but, eh). He recently came to the attention of the Ashwood Abbey at a high-society soiree, word of his interests and skill having made its way to them. Vincent is interested in what thrills the Abbey can bring him.<br /> <br /> He is in Wyoming due to rumors of creatures to hunt, while there he will procure the most lavish accommodations possible; preferably with a multi-car garage and stables.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T17:46:11-07:00","id":138674,"title":"","content":"Hey, y'all! Is there an opening for a guy like me to play? If so, then I'll write up a character sheet for Sikla Alkis to read later tonight or tomorrow. Would it be alright for him to be a mortal? I ask this question, because I want to roleplay how he becomes a hunter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 05-15-2014, 09:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T18:27:53-07:00","id":138695,"title":"","content":"Sure you can join us, Ocel! And sure he can become a hunter. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divid