iv class=\"message\">Got room for one more? I am a bit of a newbie at this, but I did play an introductory game before. I don't have a character of my own though, so I'll need to make one first. But I'll be glad to join if you're willing to have me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Welcome aboard, crapcarp! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> By the by, what ruleset do you want to use? Ocel, what rules would you like as well - GMC or pre-GMC?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T23:00:01-07:00","id":138987,"title":"","content":"Hint: the correct answer is GMC<br /> <br /> /wink","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T00:27:34-07:00","id":139087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=138969#post138969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By the by, what ruleset do you want to use, Ocel?</div> </div> </div> </div> I would like to use the God Machine Chronicles'.<br /> I am now working on my character's background, and the rest of his character sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","user":"ocel","date":". 05-16-2014, 03:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/729-ocel","name":"ocel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T01:24:21-07:00","id":139109,"title":"","content":"I'll go with GMC, as I've heard some really good things about it. Besides, I think the other group I'm entering is using pre-GMC rules(I could be wrong on that, though), so I'll get a taste of both.<br /> <br /> I'll be making up a character shortly, just gotta come up with a strong concept and build from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T07:36:41-07:00","id":139313,"title":"","content":"Welcome to the new folks joining us! I'm excited to get started soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-19T12:36:44-07:00","id":142605,"title":"","content":"Just a quick note to everyone: I'm planning to have the game started <b>this upcoming weekend</b>, so you guys have about 5-6 days to finish everything up if you want to join in at the very start. If you need more time, I can start with BridgeWarden and Proindrakenzol, and you guys can join in after the first posts. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-23T19:56:37-07:00","id":147482,"title":"","content":"Ocel has sent in his character sheet! I am now just waiting for Crapcarp to get back with his/hers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T01:22:13-07:00","id":147730,"title":"","content":"Okay, here's my character.<br /> <br /> <b>Name:</b> Eulalia Bonner<br /> <b>Gender:</b> Female<br /> <b>Age:</b> 42<br /> <br /> <b>Background:</b> Eulalia had studied psychology in the city, but went straight back to her hometown when she was done as she tired of the city-life(her hometown is basically wherever this chronicle starts, as I never lived in Wyoming). Since then, she has held a small psychology clinic that she runs by herself and has a stable, though small, clientele. She employs a unique technique for her patients, in that she lucid dreams about them after her sessions with them, gaining invaluable insight from her sub-conscious. This allows her to dig deep into her patient's psych and solve problems that would take most psychologists and psychiatrists far longer to do, and even ones that they would miss. She has a poly-phasic sleep pattern in which she sleeps for 20 minutes every 4 hours to do this. She has mastered lucid dreaming to such a fine degree that she gained clairvoyance through it, allowing her to gain even more insight by seeing into the lives of her patients. Despite her small notoriety in her town and specialist circles, she still has a small clientele. Because of this, there may be times where she doesn't get quite enough to sustain her lifestyle, as humble as it is, and has been pushed to make small and sparse shoplifts from time to time.<br /> <br /> <b>Personality:</b> She is very courteous and polite at all times, even when others are being extremely rude to her. It takes quite a lot to make her snap at someone. Having such an intimate knowledge of the human mind she can manipulate practically anyone to do her bidding through simple conversation. However, she knows that she could easily abuse her abilities and become corrupted, so she keeps herself humble to prevent this from happening. Due to her many years of psychology, she has learned all the darker aspects of humanity, giving her a pessimistic worldview. She is fully aware of the greater aspects, but she genuinely feels that oftentimes the worst of people is brought out more than their best.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://sta.sh/0i3axin7ri9\" target=\"_blank\">Character Sheet</a><br /> <br /> I'm thinking this game could be her initiation into the WoD and she becomes a hunter from the events in this game. So at the beginning of the game she's simply a mortal. What compact/conspiracy she enters after this has yet to be decided though(which is why the compact/conspiracy part has been left blank). There's still a few things to iron out(with a little help, please?), but I think it's enough to at least get started. Let me know if there's something you want added, removed, and/or changed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T10:49:05-07:00","id":147967,"title":"","content":"What do you need help ironing out, Crapcarp?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T17:42:39-07:00","id":148285,"title":"","content":"<b>THE GAME WILL START ON MONDAY, MAY 24TH, BARRING ANY COMPLICATIONS!</b><br /> <br /> If you have any last-minute changes to your stuff, do it now. After that, I will be starting, though others that want to join in later may do so if they haven't finished their character sheets. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-24T19:04:55-07:00","id":148324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=147967#post147967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you need help ironing out, Crapcarp?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I suppose there's nothing much to iron out at this point. I was thinking aspirations, but I think as I discover more about my character I'll add things like that to her. Although, I do have a couple questions.<br /> <br /> Is there anything that's wrong with the sheet or is it just fine. I'm new at this, so I need to know. Also, I heard we're allowed to use 10 dots for merits instead of 7. I was going with what the sheet said(which is 7), but if 10 merit dots are allowed I'll add the extra 3 dots in Professional Training and have Empathy, Socialize, and Investigation as Asset Skills(do I mark those with the check box at the left of each skill on the sheet?). Also, I'm guessing that 3 dots in Professional Training gives me the benefits of the 1 and 2-dot versions as well? If so, do I add 2 dots for a Contacts merit? Not exactly sure how that works either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T13:04:51-07:00","id":150740,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/127973-interest-check-for-a-slightly-off-the-wall-mortal-hunter-game?p=148324#post148324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Well, I suppose there's nothing much to iron out at this point. I was thinking aspirations, but I think as I discover more about my character I'll add things like that to her. Although, I do have a couple questions. Is there anything that's wrong with the sheet or is it just fine. I'm new at this, so I need to know. Also, I heard we're allowed to use 10 dots for merits instead of 7. I was going with what the sheet said(which is 7), but if 10 merit dots are allowed I'll add the extra 3 dots in Professional Training and have Empathy, Socialize, and Investigation as Asset Skills(do I mark those with the check box at the left of each skill on the sheet?). Also, I'm guessing that 3 dots in Professional Training gives me the benefits of the 1 and 2-dot versions as well? If so, do I add 2 dots for a Contacts merit? Not exactly sure how that works either.</div> </div> </div> </div> Taking the 3 dot version of a merit gives you the 1 and 2 dot benefits as well, it's a linear progression.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.